  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.4463 is a framework of the delegation service for transferring ownership (i.e., access rights to the Internet of things (IoT) devices) among authorized IoT devices. This Recommendation gives an overview and types of delegation service in IoT environment. It also describes the requirements and architectural models of delegation service.</abstract>
